And if you liked this video, do leave a thumbs-up,
I really appreciate it.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:47.160
Bitchin', right?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:48.160
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:49.160
Bitchin'.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.330
Thanks for enjoying Stranger Things with me
and hope you have a marvellous movie-loving

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.330
week!

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:54.170
Yippee-ki-yay, movie lovers!

